# PS Portfolio

Welcome to my personal portfolio website! This project is designed to showcase my skills, projects, and provide a way for people to connect with me.

## 🚀 Live Demo
You can view the live website here: [PS Portfolio](https://psportfolio.github.io/psportfolio/)

## ✨ Features
- **My Skills:** A clean, interactive list of my technical and creative skills. Click on any card to view a detailed description.
- **My Projects:** A showcase of my recent work and projects.
- **Contact Form:** A simple and easy-to-use form to get in touch with me directly.
- **Responsive Design:** Fully optimized to look great on mobile, tablet, and desktop screens.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used
- **HTML5**
- **CSS3** (Grid, Flexbox, Animations, Glassmorphism effects)
- **JavaScript** (DOM Manipulation for toggling descriptions)
- **GitHub Pages** (For hosting)

